      "title": "ELK-M1 Global Settings Not Configured",
      "description": "Global Settings 35-40 are not fully enabled on your ELK-M1 panel. This may affect feature functionality. Enable these settings in your panel's configuration menu:\n\n- Setting 35: Transmit Event Log (required for user tracking)\n- Setting 36: Transmit Zone Changes (required for zone updates)\n- Setting 37: Transmit Output Changes (required for output updates)\n- Setting 38: Transmit Automation Task Changes (required for task updates)\n- Setting 39: Transmit Light Changes (required for light updates)\n- Setting 40: Transmit Keypad Changes (required for alarm state tracking)\n\nSee the Elk-M1 manual for instructions on enabling these settings."
    },
